{"OptimizedCursorPaginator allows negative QuerySet slicing (cursor.offset < 0) but Django QuerySets do not support negative indexing and will raise an error - should validate and raise BadPaginationError or clamp to 0": 0.9496530294418335, "OrganizationAuditLogsEndpoint uses OptimizedCursorPaginator with order_by=-datetime but OptimizedCursorPaginator.get_item_key assumes numeric key field and calls math.floor/ceil - AuditLogEntry.datetime is a datetime so this will raise TypeError": 0.9702298045158386, "Reducing the redirect traversal limit from 10k to 1k can cause incomplete segment joins for deep redirect chains - consider keeping the previous limit or adding explicit error handling/metrics when the cap is hit": 0.8213105201721191, "ZUNIONSTORE defaults to SUM aggregation which will corrupt timestamp scores if a member exists in both source ZSETs - should use MAX or MIN aggregation instead of SUM since scores represent end_timestamp_precise for eviction ordering": 0.9441539645195007, "Second ZUNIONSTORE also needs a non-SUM aggregation (e.g. MAX) to keep timestamp scores meaningful for eviction": 0.9456419348716736, "Eviction threshold is hard-coded to 1000 but SpansBuffer exposes max_segment_spans=1001 - should wire this threshold from Python configuration for consistency": 0.6195477247238159, "Switching per-parent Redis key from Set to Sorted Set without migration/versioned keying will cause WRONGTYPE runtime failures for existing keys - consider using versioned key prefix or adding migration/compat path": 0.9761766195297241, "_load_segment_data no longer enforces max_segment_spans so a single oversized segment can be fully scanned into memory if Redis already contains an over-limit key - should reintroduce span-count guard as safety backstop": 0.93549644947052, "PR includes audit log pagination changes that are unrelated to span buffer insertion/eviction changes mentioned in title/description - consider splitting into separate PR or expanding PR description": 0.5224434733390808, "No tests asserting that segments are capped and oldest spans are evicted based on end_timestamp_precise - should add unit test for eviction behavior to prevent regressions": 0.79482102394104}